\(\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\)</span> (ordinal length)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\lambda\\to\\mathbb P\">\\(s:\\lambda\\to\\mathbb P\\)</span> (descending sequence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaClosed}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaClosed}_S\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-closed predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}closed} \\vdash \\mathrm{KappaClosed}_S(\\mathbb P,R,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,R)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall s\\;\\left(\\left[\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\lambda,\\mathbb P)\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to\\langle s(\\beta),s(\\alpha)\\rangle\\in R)\\right]\\to\\exists p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;(\\langle p,s(\\alpha)\\rangle\\in R)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}closed} \\vdash \\mathrm{KappaClosed}_S(\\mathbb P,R,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,R)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall s\\;\\left(\\left[\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\lambda,\\mathbb P)\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to\\langle s(\\beta),s(\\alpha)\\rangle\\in R)\\right]\\to\\exists p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;(\\langle p,s(\\alpha)\\rangle\\in R)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Under the usual regularity hypotheses, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-closed forcing adds no new sequences of ground-model ordinals of length less than <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>It may add new sequences of length exactly <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>; the earlier statement with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> in place of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\kappa\">\\(&lt;\\kappa\\)</span> was false.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa$ (infinite cardinal, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"